bilbo derive: write notes about entries that stopped growing, with a model.

[1mUsage:[22m
  [36mbilbo derive [--dry-run] [--redo] [--calls [39m[2m<n>[22m[36m] [[39m[2m<entry>[22m[36m...][39m

[1mOptions:[22m
      [1m--dry-run[22m    Say what a run would send, and send nothing
      [1m--redo[22m       Redo what other settings wrote and what was passed over
      [1m--calls [22m[2m<n>[22m  Make at most this many calls

[1mKinds:[22m
  [1msession[22m  bilbo ships an instruction for it
[1mProviders:[22m
  [1manthropic[22m  Anthropic's models: via api, with a key; via tool, the tool claude
  [1mopenai[22m     OpenAI's models: via api, with a key; via tool, the tool codex

[1mOutput:[22m
  entries [2m<n>[22m, calls [2m<n>[22m, notes [2m<n>[22m, dropped [2m<n>[22m, refused [2m<n>[22m, failed [2m<n>[22m
  tokens in [2m<n>[22m, tokens out [2m<n>[22m, seconds [2m<n>[22m

[1mExit:[22m
  [1m0[22m  done, also when derive is off, nothing is due or another derive runs
  [1m1[22m  a failed call, a refused entry, a busy or stopped provider, a store failure
  [1m2[22m  usage or config error

[1mExamples:[22m
  [36mbilbo derive --dry-run[39m

[1mDocs:[22m [2mhttps://github.com/delucca/bilbo/wiki/Commands#derive[22m
